flex items-center gap-2.5\"> <img src=\"https://cdn1.mirrorsecurity.io/blog-authors/9617d930-0c91-4c4f-804d-15565b35386b.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-9 w-9 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-white\" loading=\"lazy\"> <div> <div class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--title-color)]\">Mirror Security</div> <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\">Mirror Security</div> </div> </div> <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--color-mirror-700)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">\nRead\n<svg class=\"h-3 w-3\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> <path d=\"M3 6h6m0 0L6.5 3.5M9 6 6.5 8.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path> </svg> </span> </div> </div>","link":"https://mirrorsecurity.io/blog/sovereignty-without-verifiable-inference-is-a-mirage","retrieved":1764547200000},{"title":"Make the Wire Boring: How Mirror Security Defeats Side-Channel Attacks on LLM Streaming","contents":"<div class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[inherit] bg-[var(--color-surface)]\"> <img src=\"https://cdn1.mirrorsecurity.io/blog-covers/2cf89b2c-17f7-4e2e-bda2-95dac76c526b.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"absolute inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/90 dark:bg-[var(--color-surface-1)]/95 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-mirror-700)] backdrop-blur right-1 top-1\"> Security </span> </div> <div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-5\"> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\"> <span>Nov 2025</span> <span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-current opacity-40\"></span> <span>3 min read</span> </div> <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[19px] font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-tight text-[var(--title-color)] transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--color-mirror-700)]\"> Make the Wire Boring: How Mirror Security Defeats Side-Channel Attacks on LLM Streaming </h3> <p class=\"my-3 line-clamp-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\">Your encrypted LLM streams are leaking secrets through timing patterns. We make the wire boring so attackers see nothing but noise.</p> <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[var(--color-outline-variant)]/50 pt-5 mt-auto\"> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"> <img src=\"https://cdn1.mirrorsecurity.io/blog-authors/9617d930-0c91-4c4f-804d-15565b35386b.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-9 w-9 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-white\" loading=\"lazy\"> <div> <div class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--title-color)]\">Anand Chugh and Krishna Kamal Palakaluri</div> <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\">Mirror Security</div> </div> </div> <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--color-mirror-700)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">\nRead\n<svg class=\"h-3 w-3\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> <path d=\"M3 6h6m0 0L6.5 3.5M9 6 6.5 8.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path> </svg> </span> </div> </div>","link":"https://mirrorsecurity.io/blog/make-the-wire-boring-how-mirror-security-defeats-side-channel-attacks-on-llm-str","retrieved":1761955200000},{"title":"Your Entire Business is Now Just One Prompt Away","contents":"<div class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[inherit] bg-[var(--color-surface)]\"> <img src=\"https://cdn1.mirrorsecurity.io/blog-covers/f00eec16-4827-41df-826a-3fbe4d564e59.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"absolute inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/90 dark:bg-[var(--color-surface-1)]/95 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-mirror-700)] backdrop-blur right-1 top-1\"> Security </span> </div> <div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-5\"> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\"> <span>Nov 2025</span> <span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-current opacity-40\"></span> <span>3 min read</span> </div> <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[19px] font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-tight text-[var(--title-color)] transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--color-mirror-700)]\"> Your Entire Business is Now Just One Prompt Away </h3> <p class=\"my-3 line-clamp-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\">When your teams use AI IDEs, they're sending your company's crown jewels in plaintext to potential competitors. This blog exposes the platform risk playbook repeating itself in the AI age and why Fully Homomorphic Encryption is the only architectural solution that replaces trust with cryptographic proof.</p> <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[var(--color-outline-variant)]/50 pt-5 mt-auto\"> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"> <img src=\"https://cdn1.mirrorsecurity.io/blog-authors/6b6ed1a2-bbfe-40a1-a3b1-3992aa213324.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-9 w-9 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-white\" loading=\"lazy\"> <div> <div class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--title-color)]\">Krishna Kamal Palakaluri</div> <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\">Mirror Security</div> </div> </div> <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--color-mirror-700)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\">\nRead\n<svg class=\"h-3 w-3\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> <path d=\"M3 6h6m0 0L6.5 3.5M9 6 6.5 8.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path> </svg> </span> </div> </div>","link":"https://mirrorsecurity.io/blog/your-entire-business-is-now-just-one-prompt-away","retrieved":1761955200000},{"title":"Vector Database Security: Key Considerations for Enterprise Adoption","contents":"<div class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[inherit] bg-[var(--color-surface)]\"> <img src=\"https://cdn1.mirrorsecurity.io/blog-covers/cd57aefe-a3dc-4687-b052-3cc2115a95c9.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <span class=\"absolute inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/90 dark:bg-[var(--color-surface-1)]/95 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-mirror-700)] backdrop-blur right-1 top-1\"> Industry </span> </div> <div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-5\"> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\"> <span>Aug 2025</span> <span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-current opacity-40\"></span> <span>3 min read</span> </div> <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[19px] font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-tight text-[var(--title-color)] transition-colors group-hover:text-[var(--color-mirror-700)]\"> Vector Database Security: Key Considerations for Enterprise Adoption </h3> <p class=\"my-3 line-clamp-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--title-color-variant)]\">As vector databases become increasingly critical to AI and machine learning workloads, enterprises are discovering that security capabilities often lag behind functional requirements. The rush to deploy vector search solutions has left many organizations exposed to significant security gaps, particularly in regulated industries where compliance isn't optional.</p> <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between b